/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// Black Dragon Breaths: wizard spells reserved to the kit (only the Black
// Dragon Disciple is offered them: tpa/global.tpa), his acid breath in
// various shapes. Common rules:
//   - they ignore magic resistance (effects "natural", resist/dispel 0)
//   - impact: 1d4 acid damage per caster level, capped by the spell level,
//     no save
//   - the acid keeps eating: half the impact again the next round (opcode
//     12, timing 4, 6 seconds), save vs. Breath negates
//   - the disciple roars (NY#BROAR) and holds still 1 second while he
//     breathes (opcode 165); he is not hit by his own breath (opcode 206 on
//     himself, 2 seconds)
//
// NY#BLIN   Black Dragon Breath: Line, level 2 (WIZARD_NY_BREATH_LINE): the
//           basic breath, no casting time. 1d4 per level, 4d4 at least, 8d4
//           at most (headers 1, 5, 6, 7, 8). Projectile NY#BLIL (invisible
//           line, 30 ft.); the line of explosions is played on the disciple,
//           facing the target, in two layers: black smoke NY#BLIK and glowing
//           acid NY#BLIG (VVC, 9 orientations mirrored to 16).
//           Icons NY#BLINB / NY#BLINC.
// NY#BORB   Orb, level 1: one creature (projectile NY#BORB, the green orb
//           NY#BORBT); 2d4, +1d4 at levels 3, 5, 7 (headers 1, 3, 5, 7). The
//           creature hit casts at its own feet the shards NY#BORS<n> (opcode
//           148; projectile NY#BORBS, 10 ft.): 1d4 less on the enemies around
//           it (allies and neutrals immune: SPLPROT row EA < 200; the creature
//           hit immune for 1 second).
// NY#BTRP   Trap, level 3: Skull Trap's trap with the orb, then the breaths'
//           explosion (projectile NY#BTRP, 20 ft.); 1d4 per level, 10d4.
// NY#BBAL   Ball, level 4: the slow orb, then the explosion (NY#BBAL, 20 ft.)
//           and its black puffs (NY#BBALK, cast at the same point); 1d4 per
//           level, 12d4.
// NY#BCON   Cone, level 5: the Dragon Disciple's cone with the explosion
//           (NY#BCON) and its black puffs (NY#BCONK); 1d4 per level, 15d4;
//           pause, the disciple not hit.
// NY#BCLD   Cloud, level 6: Cloudkill's cloud in yellow (NY#BCLOK, works/
//           restructure/cloud_yellow.py; projectile NY#BCLD), 6 pulses about
//           one per round: 4d4, save vs. Breath for half. Its black cloud
//           NY#BCLDK (opcode 148, as the Cone's black puffs).
// NY#BRAI   Rain, level 7: IWD:EE's Acid Storm (projectile NY#BRAI; rain,
//           splash and icons in the breaths' yellow, works/restructure/
//           rain_yellow.py;
//           rain NY#BRAIA, splash NY#BRAIX, sound NY#BRAIS, icons NY#BRAIB/C):
//           1d4 every round, 14 rounds, one more per level from 15; save
//           vs. Breath for half each; roar; ignores magic resistance. Its
//           black rain NY#BRAIK (opcode 148, as the Cone's black puffs).
// NY#BERU   Eruption, level 8: the explosion 20 ft. around the disciple
//           (NY#BERU) and its black puffs (NY#BERUK); 1d4 per level, 20d4;
//           allies hit, not the disciple.
// NY#BBOL   Bolt, level 9: one creature (Melf's Acid Arrow's projectile);
//           20d4; failed save vs. Breath: NY#BBOLX (10d4 the next round, and
//           the curse rolls NY#BBOR1-6: each casts its curse NY#BCUR1-6 with
//           a 15% chance, its own roll). Curses: 1 poison, 2 disease (4
//           rounds), 3 insects, 4 swamp plants, 5 fear, 6 blindness (2 rounds).
// Icons NY#B<code>B / C: placeholders, the former breath icons.
/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

// spell, wizard level, SPELL.IDS name; names and descriptions: @1, @2 for
// the first, then two by two
OUTER_SET tra = 1
ACTION_FOR_EACH entry IN ~blin 2 LINE~ ~borb 1 ORB~ ~btrp 3 TRAP~ ~bbal 4 BALL~ ~bcon 5 CONE~
                         ~bcld 6 CLOUD~ ~brai 7 RAIN~ ~beru 8 ERUPTION~ ~bbol 9 BOLT~ BEGIN
  OUTER_PATCH_SAVE res  ~%entry%~ BEGIN REPLACE_TEXTUALLY ~ .*~ ~~ END
  OUTER_PATCH_SAVE lv   ~%entry%~ BEGIN REPLACE_TEXTUALLY ~^[^ ]+ \([0-9]\) .*~ ~\1~ END
  OUTER_PATCH_SAVE form ~%entry%~ BEGIN REPLACE_TEXTUALLY ~.* ~ ~~ END
  LAF NY#ICON_B_FROM_C STR_VAR b = EVAL ~NY#%res%B~ c = EVAL ~NY#%res%C~ END   // Remastered Spell Icons
  OUTER_SET name = RESOLVE_STR_REF ((AT ~tra~))
  OUTER_SET tra += 1
  OUTER_SET desc = RESOLVE_STR_REF ((AT ~tra~))
  OUTER_SET tra += 1
  COPY_EXISTING ~ny#%res%.spl~ ~override~
    WRITE_LONG 0x08 name
    WRITE_LONG 0x50 desc
  ADD_SPELL ~override/ny#%res%.spl~ 2 lv ~WIZARD_NY_BREATH_%form%~
END
